 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"ad70e2a6-3df8-4ed8-a63f-e586e4ed032c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
From the centre of a 3 \[Times] 3 grid eight rays leave, two through each \
neighbour, each ending at a corner.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"81eb426a-12b1-441d-b6ce-3b156db940ae"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

